     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial,sans-serif\">請問關於aggregate這個指令的用法<br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><font color=\"#999999\">webs.agg &lt;- aggregate(webs$Time, list(Protocol=webs$Protocol),sum) </font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">這一串程式代表的是什麼意思？</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">還有後面的sum計算的是哪兩個元素？</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br></div><div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">x&lt;- read.csv(&quot;Time.csv&quot;)</span></font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">str(x)</span></font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">vars=c(&quot;Protocol&quot;)</span></font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">x[1:20,vars]</span></font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Time = with(x,</span></font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">c( length(No[which(Protocol==&quot;UDP&quot;)]),</span></font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">   length(No[which(Protocol==&quot;TCP&quot;)]),</span></font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">   length(No[which(Protocol==&quot;ARP&quot;)]),</span></font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">   length(No[which(Protocol==&quot;DNS&quot;)]),</span></font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">   length(No[which(Protocol==&quot;TLSv1.2&quot;)]) ) )</span></font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> barplot(Time,names.arg=c(&quot;UDP&quot;,&quot;TCP&quot;,&quot;ARP&quot;,&quot;DNS&quot;,&quot;TLSv1.2&quot;),density=rep(20,5),</span></font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> main=&quot;Protocol&quot;,xlab=&quot;Protocol&quot;,ylab=&quot;No&quot;</span></font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> )  </span></font></div></div><div><br></div><div>還有請問如果是上述的程式碼</div><div>要改為長條圖排名顯示的話 我該怎麼修改</div><div>*圖片為程式碼輸出後結果</div></div>"
