     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Ruzi,<div><br></div><div>問題1:</div><div><div>webs.agg &lt;- aggregate(webs$Time, list(Protocol=webs$Protocol),sum) , 其中 aggregate(1, 2,3) 分別表示如下, 有問題可輸入 <font color=\"#ff0000\">?aggregate</font> 查閱線上說明:</div><div>  </div><div>1. 計算欄位</div><div>2. 群組欄位</div><div>3. 計算函數</div><div><br></div><div>本例是依據 Protocol 欄位為群組, 計算各群組 Time 欄位的加總值</div><div><br></div><div>問題2:<br></div><div># title: 依資料大小排序長條圖</div><div># date: 2015.5.22</div><div>webs &lt;- data.frame(Protocol=gl(5,4,label=c(&quot;UDP&quot;,&quot;TCP&quot;,&quot;ARP&quot;,&quot;DNS&quot;,&quot;TLSv1.2&quot;)),</div><div>                   Time=c(60000,70000,80000,80000,100000,</div><div>                          100000,100000,250000,20,30,</div><div>                          40,10,5000,5000,10000,</div><div>                          10000,50000,60000,70000,70000))</div><div><br></div><div>Time &lt;- with(webs,</div><div>            c( sum(Time[which(Protocol==&quot;UDP&quot;)]),</div><div>               sum(Time[which(Protocol==&quot;TCP&quot;)]),</div><div>               sum(Time[which(Protocol==&quot;ARP&quot;)]),</div><div>               sum(Time[which(Protocol==&quot;DNS&quot;)]),</div><div>               sum(Time[which(Protocol==&quot;TLSv1.2&quot;)])))</div><div><br></div><div>names(Time) &lt;- levels(webs$Protocol)</div><div>Time &lt;- Time[order(Time, decreasing=TRUE)] # 長條圖排名顯示的</div><div>barplot(Time,density=rep(20,5),</div><div>        main=&quot;Protocol&quot;,xlab=&quot;Protocol&quot;,ylab=&quot;Time&quot;)</div><div># end</div><div><br></div><div># 繪圖結果:</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-1D7Vg5ief7g/VV6V8K9vDbI/AAAAAAAAJkM/sXFxLlVq1hY/s1600/%25E4%25BE%259D%25E8%25B3%2587%25E6%2596%2599%25E5%25A4%25A7%25E5%25B0%258F%25E6%258E%2592%25E5%25BA%258F%25E9%2595%25B7%25E6%25A2%259D%25E5%259C%2596.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-1D7Vg5ief7g/VV6V8K9vDbI/AAAAAAAAJkM/sXFxLlVq1hY/s1600/%2525E4%2525BE%25259D%2525E8%2525B3%252587%2525E6%252596%252599%2525E5%2525A4%2525A7%2525E5%2525B0%25258F%2525E6%25258E%252592%2525E5%2525BA%25258F%2525E9%252595%2525B7%2525E6%2525A2%25259D%2525E5%25259C%252596.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238333936000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1vA0j6v24MFcLA7D6kWAMS\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-1D7Vg5ief7g/VV6V8K9vDbI/AAAAAAAAJkM/sXFxLlVq1hY/s320/%25E4%25BE%259D%25E8%25B3%2587%25E6%2596%2599%25E5%25A4%25A7%25E5%25B0%258F%25E6%258E%2592%25E5%25BA%258F%25E9%2595%25B7%25E6%25A2%259D%25E5%259C%2596.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"283\"></a></p><div><br></div><div><br></div><br>Ruzi於 2015年5月19日星期二 UTC+8下午9時38分51秒寫道：</div></div>"
